    "title": "Character-level Shakespeare GPT trained on CPU, then sampled",
    "whyChosen": "This is the README's own \"I only have a macbook\" route (README.md:82-103). It downloads a 1MB text file, trains a tiny 4-layer GPT for about 3 minutes on CPU, and prints Shakespeare-like samples. That fits the 20-minute CPU budget with no GPU and no large downloads.",
